      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.81,
      "end_seconds": 12.88,
      "duration_seconds": 5.07,
      "text": "so, that's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.11,
      "end_seconds": 20.42,
      "duration_seconds": 6.31,
      "text": "Um, um, so... swollen lips at times. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.49,
      "end_seconds": 25.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.33,
      "end_seconds": 30.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "I've had it for four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.02,
      "end_seconds": 34.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "how frequently does it come?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.9,
      "end_seconds": 42.0,
      "duration_seconds": 7.1,
      "text": "it happens a few times a day. And poor sleep from itching, too"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.8,
      "end_seconds": 48.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.58,
      "end_seconds": 53.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Not to my knowledge, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.59,
      "end_seconds": 57.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "what line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.77,
      "end_seconds": 64.07,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.55,
      "end_seconds": 67.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.49,
      "end_seconds": 72.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.47,
      "end_seconds": 76.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "so is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.15,
      "end_seconds": 80.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.07,
      "end_seconds": 84.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.75,
      "end_seconds": 89.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "no, I've never been operated on"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.65,
      "end_seconds": 98.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.91,
      "end_seconds": 105.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "I'm on cetirizine 10 milligrams once a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.57,
      "end_seconds": 122.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "what about your parents brothers or sisters any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.71,
      "end_seconds": 126.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "My grandfather had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.9,
      "end_seconds": 131.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.69,
      "end_seconds": 134.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "I've got acid reflux."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.59,
      "end_seconds": 140.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "Yes, acid reflux is known to us, good to have that clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.33,
      "end_seconds": 155.09,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any throat tightness, joint pain or difficulty breathing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.56,
      "end_seconds": 161.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "No, no throat tightness, joint pain or difficulty breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.28,
      "end_seconds": 167.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Right is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.9,
      "end_seconds": 170.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "no, joints are fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.11,
      "end_seconds": 186.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "so, I'll just record a few vital signs"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.35,
      "end_seconds": 197.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Okay, bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.09,
      "end_seconds": 223.7,
      "duration_seconds": 8.61,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 125 over 81, saturation 97 percent. And pulse is 84 beats a minute, temperature is 36.9 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.11,
      "end_seconds": 226.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.81,
      "end_seconds": 232.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "They help me see the whole picture, more shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.86,
      "end_seconds": 235.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "May I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.86,
      "end_seconds": 239.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "okay, raise your arm for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.84,
      "end_seconds": 256.28,
      "duration_seconds": 5.44,
      "text": "there are pink raised wheals on the arms and trunk that blanch with pressure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.7,
      "end_seconds": 268.12,
      "duration_seconds": 7.42,
      "text": "You can sit up now. So where does that leave us? My working impression is chronic spontaneous urticaria."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 269.79,
      "end_seconds": 271.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.76,
      "end_seconds": 302.98,
      "duration_seconds": 30.22,
      "text": "I understand the worry at the moment I'd say it's chronic spontaneous urticaria, and we'll know more once the blood tests is back let's get blood tests, for chronic urticaria that will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step i'm prescribing fexofenadine, 180 milligrams, once a day, long term you take it by mouth that's for urticaria i'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.08,
      "end_seconds": 314.96,
      "duration_seconds": 9.88,
      "text": "keep a diary of foods and triggers and avoid hot showers. Do get help quickly if you have swelling of the lips with trouble breathing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.57,
      "end_seconds": 318.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "I know what to watch for."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.45,
      "end_seconds": 326.41,
      "duration_seconds": 6.96,
      "text": "see me again in six weeks. Right, is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.1,
      "end_seconds": 330.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.86,
      "end_seconds": 332.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "see you soon"
    }
  ]
